('115.13.b.3.F',2,'Which is a respectful way to talk?','["say mean names", "roll your eyes", "use a calm voice and say please", "yell and point"]'::jsonb,2,'Calm words show respect.','original'),
('115.13.b.3.F',3,'Looking at the speaker shows respect without using any...','["shoes", "paper", "ears", "words"]'::jsonb,3,'Eye contact is nonverbal communication.','original'),
('115.13.b.3.G',2,'A friend is crying at recess. They are probably feeling...','["sad", "proud", "excited", "silly"]'::jsonb,0,'Tears often show sadness.','original'),
('115.13.b.3.G',3,'Someone with clenched fists and a frown may be feeling...','["calm", "angry", "sleepy", "joyful"]'::jsonb,1,'Body language shows emotion.','original'),
('115.13.b.3.H',3,'Two friends both want the swing. A fair way to solve it is to...','["fight", "tattle on everyone", "take turns", "break the swing"]'::jsonb,2,'Turn taking solves conflicts.','original'),
('115.13.b.3.H',3,'When friends disagree, a good first step is to...','["walk away mad", "spread rumors", "push", "talk it out calmly"]'::jsonb,3,'Calm talking solves problems.','original'),
('115.13.b.4.A',3,'Being kind to yourself means you...','["talk to yourself with encouragement", "give up right away", "call yourself names", "never rest"]'::jsonb,0,'Kind self-talk builds confidence.','original'),
('115.13.b.4.A',3,'An area for growth is something you...','["already do perfectly", "want to get better at", "hide from everyone", "never think about"]'::jsonb,1,'Growth areas are skills to improve.','original'),
('115.13.b.4.B',2,'Why is setting a goal helpful?','["it stops time", "it gives free candy", "it gives you something to work toward", "it makes homework disappear"]'::jsonb,2,'Goals guide effort.','original'),
('115.13.b.4.B',3,'Finishing a task you start shows...','["silliness", "worry", "laziness", "responsibility"]'::jsonb,3,'Task completion builds responsibility.','original'),
