('115.13.b.8.A',3,'You should not give food to a classmate with allergies unless...','["they ask loudly", "you are hungry", "it looks tasty", "a trusted adult says it is safe"]'::jsonb,3,'Adults check ingredients.','original'),
('115.13.b.8.B',2,'Getting enough sleep helps your body and mind to...','["rest and grow", "hide", "stay awake all night", "shrink"]'::jsonb,0,'Sleep restores energy.','original'),
('115.13.b.8.B',3,'Eating breakfast helps you...','["forget lessons", "have energy for school", "lose your voice", "feel sleepier"]'::jsonb,1,'Breakfast fuels learning.','original'),
('115.13.b.9.A',3,'Which is a way to keep yourself safe near a street?','["run ahead", "play in traffic", "hold a grown-up''s hand", "chase a ball into the road"]'::jsonb,2,'Adults help you cross safely.','original'),
('115.13.b.9.A',3,'If a stranger offers you a ride, you should...','["keep it a secret", "get in", "go with them", "say no and tell a trusted adult"]'::jsonb,3,'Never go with strangers.','original'),
('115.13.b.9.B',2,'What is the purpose of a helmet when you ride a scooter?','["protect your head", "make you faster", "look silly", "keep you cool"]'::jsonb,0,'Helmets protect from head injuries.','original'),
('115.13.b.9.B',3,'A car seat or booster seat is used to...','["cool the car", "keep children safe in a car", "make the car quiet", "store snacks"]'::jsonb,1,'Child seats protect kids in crashes.','original'),
('115.13.b.10.A',3,'Someone you do not know touches your arm and you feel uncomfortable. You can say...','["nothing", "\"Sure.\"", "\"Stop! Don''t touch me.\"", "\"Do it again.\""]'::jsonb,2,'Refusal skills protect personal space.','original'),
('115.13.b.10.A',3,'A strong refusal includes a loud voice and...','["giggling", "hiding forever", "keeping it secret", "walking away to a safe adult"]'::jsonb,3,'Leave and tell someone you trust.','original'),
('115.13.b.10.B',2,'Privacy means...','["keeping some things to yourself", "sharing every detail with strangers", "forgetting", "being loud"]'::jsonb,0,'Privacy protects personal things.','original'),
('115.13.b.10.B',3,'Personal boundaries tell others how...','["fast to run", "close they can come or touch you", "loud to sing", "tall to be"]'::jsonb,1,'Boundaries are your limits.','original'),
('115.13.b.10.C',2,'Why should you memorize a trusted adult''s phone number?','["so you can sell it", "so you can forget it", "so you can call for help", "so you can lose it"]'::jsonb,2,'A phone number helps in an emergency.','original'),
('115.13.b.10.C',3,'If you are lost, it helps to know your...','["shoe size", "lunch menu", "favorite cartoon", "parent''s phone number"]'::jsonb,3,'Phone numbers let you reach family.','original'),
('115.13.b.11.A',2,'Which place is safest to play?','["a fenced backyard with an adult nearby", "a river bank alone", "a roof", "a busy parking lot"]'::jsonb,0,'Safe places are watched and secure.','original'),
('115.13.b.11.A',3,'An unsafe environment might have...','["a clear path", "broken glass or no adults nearby", "a grown-up watching", "soft grass and a fence"]'::jsonb,1,'Broken glass is hazardous.','original'),
('115.13.b.11.B',3,'If you see a gun, you should...','["show friends", "pick it up", "stay away and tell a trusted adult", "point it"]'::jsonb,2,'Never touch a weapon.','original'),
('115.13.b.11.B',3,'Telling an adult about a dangerous situation helps...','["get people in trouble for no reason", "lose a friend", "make a mess", "keep people safe"]'::jsonb,3,'Reporting prevents harm.','original'),
('115.13.b.12',3,'Being a good digital citizen means you...','["are kind online and ask a grown-up before sharing", "share passwords with friends", "tease online", "post private info"]'::jsonb,0,'Respect and safety matter online.','original'),
('115.13.b.12',3,'Which should you never share with someone you meet online?','["your favorite color", "your home address", "a drawing", "a joke"]'::jsonb,1,'Never share private info with strangers.','original'),
('115.13.b.12',3,'Before downloading a game, you should...','["ignore warnings", "click everything", "ask a trusted adult", "share your password"]'::jsonb,2,'Adults check safety.','original'),
('115.13.b.13.A',3,'One result of bullying for the target is feeling...','["excited", "proud", "always happy", "sad or afraid"]'::jsonb,3,'Bullying hurts feelings.','original'),
('115.13.b.13.A',3,'A bully may face consequences such as...','["losing privileges at school", "getting free toys", "winning a prize", "getting more friends"]'::jsonb,0,'Bullying has consequences.','original'),
('115.13.b.13.B',3,'One way to discourage bullying is to...','["laugh along", "stand with the person being bullied", "stay silent", "spread the story"]'::jsonb,1,'Support discourages bullies.','original'),
('115.13.b.13.B',2,'If you see bullying, you can...','["ignore it", "record it for fun", "get a trusted adult", "join in"]'::jsonb,2,'Adults can stop bullying.','original'),
('115.13.b.13.C',3,'Teasing becomes bullying when it is...','["a game with fair rules", "a hug", "a one-time friendly joke", "meant to hurt and happens again and again"]'::jsonb,3,'Bullying is repeated and hurtful.','original'),
('115.13.b.13.C',3,'Which is playing around rather than bullying?','["friends laughing together during a game", "leaving a classmate out on purpose", "someone pushing another on purpose every day", "calling someone names to hurt them"]'::jsonb,0,'Playing around is fun for everyone.','original'),
('115.13.b.13.D',3,'If someone makes you feel unsafe, a good choice is to...','["ignore your feelings", "tell a parent or trusted adult", "try to fix it alone", "keep it a secret"]'::jsonb,1,'Trusted adults can help.','original'),
('115.13.b.13.D',3,'A trusted adult at school could be...','["a pet", "a character on TV", "a teacher or counselor", "a stranger"]'::jsonb,2,'School staff can help.','original'),
('115.13.b.14.A',3,'A medicine you can buy without a doctor''s note is called...','["poison", "pretend", "prescription", "over-the-counter"]'::jsonb,3,'Over-the-counter drugs do not need a prescription.','original'),
('115.13.b.14.A',3,'A prescription drug is medicine that...','["a doctor orders for a specific person", "is food", "is candy", "anyone can take"]'::jsonb,0,'Prescription medicine is ordered by a doctor.','original'),
('115.13.b.14.B',3,'Tobacco use harms the...','["nails", "lungs and heart", "hair color", "shoe size"]'::jsonb,1,'Tobacco harms organs.','original'),
('115.13.b.14.B',3,'Vaping and cigarettes both contain a harmful drug called...','["iron", "calcium", "nicotine", "vitamin C"]'::jsonb,2,'Nicotine is addictive.','original'),
('115.13.b.14.B',3,'Household cleaners are dangerous if they are...','["used by an adult safely", "stored on a high shelf", "kept in the original bottle", "swallowed"]'::jsonb,3,'Swallowing cleaners can poison.','original'),
('115.13.b.15',3,'If someone swallowed something harmful, you should tell a grown-up and call...','["Poison Control or 911", "the dog", "nobody", "a friend"]'::jsonb,0,'Poison Control gives emergency help.','original'),
('115.13.b.15',3,'Calling for help when someone has taken a harmful substance is called getting...','["a snack", "emergency help", "a haircut", "a toy"]'::jsonb,1,'Fast help saves lives.','original'),
('115.13.b.16',3,'A protective factor that helps kids stay away from drugs is...','["boredom", "peer pressure to try drugs", "a caring family", "a stranger offering something"]'::jsonb,2,'Support protects kids.','original'),
('115.13.b.16',3,'A risk factor for drug use is...','["a supportive coach", "healthy hobbies", "a happy home", "friends who pressure you"]'::jsonb,3,'Pressure is a risk.','original'),
('115.13.b.17',3,'If someone offers you a drug, a good refusal is...','["\"No thanks, I''m leaving.\"", "\"Okay.\"", "\"Let me try.\"", "\"Maybe later.\""]'::jsonb,0,'Clear refusals protect you.','original'),
('115.13.b.17',3,'After you refuse an unsafe offer, you should...','["go back", "tell a trusted adult", "accept it", "keep it secret"]'::jsonb,1,'Reporting keeps you safe.','original')
) as v(code, diff, prompt, choices, ans, expl, src)
join public.teks_items i on i.code = v.code and i.is_standard
join public.teks_documents d on d.id = i.document_id and d.subject = 'Health Education' and d.language = 'en'
on conflict (fingerprint) do nothing;
